Create and automatically persist SSH based tunnels using autossh.

Establishes local, remote and dynamic SSH port forwards (and layer 2/3
tun/tap tunnels) that are monitored and automatically re-established when
they fail.

This is a modernized rewrite of the original Threat Patrols os-autossh
plugin, which was last released for OPNsense 25.1. It reads the same
configuration section (//ThreatPatrols/Autossh) so existing tunnel and key
definitions are carried over as-is.

WWW: https://github.com/jonwedell/opnsense-plugin-autossh
